# Only the distributable archive is ignored.
#
# The derived rasters ARE committed, deliberately. README banners, badges, the avatar and
# the social preview are referenced by URL from README.md and from GitHub settings — if they
# are not in the tree, every one of those references 404s. The whole assets/ tree is ~270 KB
# and changes only when the brand changes, which is not churn worth optimising away.
#
# Regenerate with: uv run --with pillow --with playwright brand/build.py --with-browser
dist/
